## 1. Core KPIs (Success Criteria from Problem Statement)

| KPI Number | KPI Name | Description | Verification Method | Target Value | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| KPI-001 | Payment Flow Works | Complete donation using Razorpay test mode end-to-end | E2E Test (test card: 4111 1111 1111 1111) | 100% success rate | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-002 | Thank-You Page Displayed | Thank-you page renders after successful payment with donation details | E2E Test — verify redirect to /thank-you + content check | Displayed within 3 seconds | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-003 | Admin Views Donor Log | Admin can login and view all donation entries in a table | E2E Test — login + table verification | All donations visible | ☐ Pending |

