## 2. Functional KPIs

| KPI Number | KPI Name | Description | Verification Method | Target Value | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| KPI-004 | Cause Display | Donation page shows cause title, description, and progress | Manual Testing | Cause data rendered from Supabase | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-005 | Amount Selection | Donor can select predefined amount or enter custom amount | Unit Test + E2E | ₹100, ₹500, ₹1000, ₹2000 + custom | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-006 | Donor Form Validation | Required fields validated — name (required), email (required, format), phone (optional) | Unit Test | All validations pass | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-007 | Payment Signature Verified | Server verifies Razorpay payment signature before saving | Integration Test | Invalid signatures rejected (400) | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-008 | Webhook Processing | Razorpay webhook updates donation status correctly | Integration Test | payment.captured → completed | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-009 | Admin Authentication | Admin login with Supabase Auth works, session persists | E2E Test | Login → dashboard redirect | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-010 | Donor Search | Admin can search donors by name or email | E2E Test | Search returns matching results | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-011 | Date Filter | Admin can filter donations by date range | E2E Test | Filtered results accurate | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-012 | Dashboard Stats | Admin sees total donations count and total amount | Integration Test | Aggregated correctly from DB | ☐ Pending |

