## 3. Performance KPIs

| KPI Number | KPI Name | Description | Verification Method | Target Value | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| KPI-013 | Donation Page Load | Time to fully render donation page | Lighthouse CI | < 3 seconds | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-014 | API Response Time | Response time for create-order and verify-payment | Integration Test + Timing | < 500ms | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-015 | Admin Dashboard Load | Time to render admin dashboard with stats | Manual + Lighthouse | < 3 seconds | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-016 | Donor Table Render | Time to render donor table with 100 records | Manual Testing | < 2 seconds | ☐ Pending |

