## 4. Security KPIs

| KPI Number | KPI Name | Description | Verification Method | Target Value | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| KPI-017 | No Payment Data Stored | Card/UPI details never stored in Supabase | Security Audit / Code Review | Zero sensitive payment data | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-018 | Webhook Signature Check | Every webhook call signature-verified | Integration Test | 100% verification rate | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-019 | Admin Route Protection | All /admin/* routes reject unauthenticated access | Security Test | 401 for unauthenticated | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-020 | RLS Enforcement | Supabase RLS blocks public read on donations table | RLS Test | Anon role gets zero rows | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-021 | Secrets Not Exposed | key_secret and service_role never in client bundle | Code Review / Build Audit | Zero client-side exposure | ☐ Pending |

