| KPI Number | KPI Name | Description | Verification Method | Target Value | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| KPI-022 | Mobile Responsive | Donation page usable on mobile (360px+) | Manual + Lighthouse | Responsive on all breakpoints | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-023 | Form Error Messages | Invalid inputs show clear inline errors | Unit Test + Manual | All fields have error states | ☐ Pending |
| KPI-024 | Loading States | Loading indicators during payment processing | Manual Testing | Spinner/skeleton visible | ☐ Pending |
