## 6. Acceptance Criteria Summary

### Must Pass (MVP Gate)
- [x] KPI-001: Payment flow works in test mode
- [x] KPI-002: Thank-you page displayed
- [x] KPI-003: Admin can view donor log
- [x] KPI-007: Payment signature verified
- [x] KPI-009: Admin authentication works
- [x] KPI-017: No payment data stored
- [x] KPI-019: Admin routes protected

### Should Pass (Quality Gate)
- [ ] KPI-004 through KPI-012: All functional KPIs
- [ ] KPI-013 through KPI-016: All performance KPIs
- [ ] KPI-022 through KPI-025: All UX KPIs

### Must Pass (Security Gate)
- [x] KPI-017 through KPI-021: All security KPIs

